eval/REPORT.md
eval/report.json
eval-report/

# B5 runtime store artifacts (issue #63) - never track databases
desktop/store/

# Playwright-under-Electron artifacts (issue #67 e2e)
desktop/test-results/
desktop/playwright-report/
web_ui/test-results/
web_ui/playwright-report/

# packtool/build/ is SOURCE (the issue #79 pack builder modules), not output;
# the generic `build/` pattern above is for compiled output dirs.
!packtool/build/
eval/bakeoff/assets/
